<header><p class="enc-kicker">People / group</p><h1 class="enc-title">Somalis</h1><p class="enc-meta">Also known as Somali</p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">The Somalis are a Cushitic-speaking people of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/horn-of-africa">Horn of Africa</a>, predominantly Muslim. They formed an important part of the forces and population of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/adal-sultanate">Adal Sultanate</a>. The Adal Sultanate profile notes their role in its economy and military campaigns.</p></div>
